# Environment, Service & Directory Catalog (`dev_md_guides/directory.md.sample`)
_Single source of truth for workspace paths, servers, backend links, and endpoints._  
_All living guides in `dev_md_guides/` rely on the keys defined here rather than hardcoding paths or URLs._

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Deployment Rule**: Only deploy `directory.md.sample` with sanitized examples to GitHub.
> Keep `directory.md` gitignored for active machine/environment values and private endpoints.

## 1. Local Workspace & Project Directories
- **Project Root**: `.` (Repository root worktree)
- **Living Guides Directory**: `./dev_md_guides`
- **Application Assets Directory**: `./assets` (`assets/icon.ico`)
- **Distribution / Build Directory**: `./` (`rsync-ui.exe`, `rs_copy.exe`)
- **Configuration File**: `./config.json`

## 2. Infrastructure & Named Pipes
- **Single-Instance IPC Pipe**: `\\.\pipe\rsync-ui-ipc` (Transfers structured LaunchPayload to active UI instance)
- **Elevated USN Service Pipe**: `\\.\pipe\rsync-service-pipe` (Allows non-elevated UI to query NTFS USN Journal)

## 3. Remote Sync Servers (Sample)
- **Primary Backup Server**: `backup-srv.internal` (Host: `192.168.1.100`, Port: `22`, User: `backup_user`, Remote Path: `/var/backups/data`)
- **Secondary Offsite Server**: `offsite-srv.example.com` (Host: `offsite.example.com`, Port: `2222`, User: `sync_admin`, Remote Path: `/data/mirrors`)

## 4. GitHub & Release Links
- **Public Repository**: `https://github.com/pgwiz/rsync-controller`
- **Releases Portal**: `https://github.com/pgwiz/rsync-controller/releases`
- **CI / Actions Portal**: `https://github.com/pgwiz/rsync-controller/actions`
